{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Aaron saw.</b> That they had erred, and he feared lest they pay attention and say: what will this avail us? And they would set over themselves a leader — therefore ויבן מזבח לפניו, to delay them until Moses would come." "<b>And he said: A festival to YHWH tomorrow.</b> That is: tomorrow we shall enthrone him, and we shall make a festival to YHWH over [our] leader, and we shall bring shelamim offerings to the name of the Holy One, blessed be He, just as we find with Saul when the kingship was renewed."], :book :exodus, :voice :daat-zkenim, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T13:04:28.246519676Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}